From u1f723d378f24adbb at groups.google.com  Sun Mar  2 11:01:50 2014
From: u1f723d378f24adbb at groups.google.com (Tamas Papp)
Date: Sun, 02 Mar 2014 11:01:50 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] sampling syntax vs. increment_log_prob
