I wasn't with my comment trying to get into whether the abstraction
the Stan language provides is a good or bad one. I do tend to think of
it more as an abstraction than syntactic sugar. When the project adds
functions I think it will get harder to argue that it is all merely
syntactic sugar.

I am more suggesting that a good deal of the confusion some users are
having with the more complex models may be stemming from thinking of
Stan as a proper language and getting confused by increment_log.

