Bob,

You were right, after increasing warmup chains started to mix.

In my excitement I have crafted stan code with generated quantities
block.  The second code was much faster.  However, the predictions are
off for the stan code with the generated quantities block (as you have
suggested previously).  Both codes generate comparable posteriors.  I
guess there is some subtle difference between both codes I am unable to
grasp.  Can you please help?

Linas

