Subject: Re: [stan-users] beta fails with [0, 1] data
Message-ID: <UB6wt-Mpyo0.RIpHhOPIRooJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <UB6wt-Mpyo0.PsFuiX68jN0J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
