Subject: Speed/parameter estimation in hierarchical logistic regression
Message-ID: <X7BjU4MrmrQ.F1IyTVKElt8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/X7BjU4MrmrQ/m/F1IyTVKElt8J>
