If you still want DIC, using the previous example, you can add the following code to the generated parameters block (had to dig it out of my git repository 150 or so commits back :) )
real dev;
dev <- 0;

for (i in 1:N) {

  dev <- dev - (2 * lognormal_log(Y[i], mu, sigma));
}

And then calculate DIC as mean(dev) + .5 * var(dev)

